of enemies in environments that pulse with energy and sound. Every dodge, strike, and reload is choreographed to the soundtrack, creating a visceral fusion of music and motion.\nDesigned for both casual and competitive players, Beat Ops offers:\n\u2022 \t\ud83c\udfa7 Beat-synced combat mechanics that reward timing, precision, and flow\n\u2022 \t\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Fully immersive VR environments with reactive visuals and spatial audio\nranks\n\u2022 \t\ud83c\udfa8 A bold art style blending neon aesthetics with tactical realism\nBeat Ops aims to carve a niche in the growing VR rhythm genre by combining the kinetic thrill of shooters with the emotional engagement of music. It\u2019s not just a game\u2014it\u2019s a performance.", "short_description": "Beat Ops is a rhythm-action VR game that fuses high-intensity combat with pulse-pounding music, immersing players in a futuristic battlefield where every beat is a weapon."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beatops.in/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://beatops.in/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Stag Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://beatops.in/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24974378392226020"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5, "nodes": 